		summary = "**Mount Pinatubo** is an active stratovolcano in the Zambales Mountains in [[Luzon]] in the [[Philippines]]. Located on the tripoint of Zambales, Tarlac and Pampanga provinces, most people were unaware of its eruptive history before the pre-eruption volcanic activity in early 1991. Dense [[Forest|forests]], which supported a population of several thousand indigenous Aetas, heavily [[Erosion|eroded]] and obscured Pinatubo.",
